<view class="page"><view class="title">资源编辑</view><view wx:if="{{status === 'loading'}}" class="state">正在验证权限…</view><view wx:elif="{{status === 'error'}}" class="state"><view>{{error}}</view><button class="primary" bindtap="load">重试</button></view><view wx:else class="card"><view class="notice">{{resourceStatus === 'published' ? '已发布 · 本阶段只读' : '草稿 · 保存后再发布'}}。不填联系方式，不在这里发布个人简历。</view><label class="label">标题</label><input value="{{form.title}}" data-field="title" bindinput="input" maxlength="120" disabled="{{busy || resourceStatus === 'published'}}"/><label class="label">资源简介</label><textarea value="{{form.summary}}" data-field="summary" bindinput="input" maxlength="1200" disabled="{{busy || resourceStatus === 'published'}}"/><view class="label">分类</view><view class="choice-row"><button wx:for="{{categories}}" wx:key="id" class="choice {{form.category === item.id ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="selectCategory" disabled="{{busy || resourceStatus === 'published'}}">{{item.label}}</button></view><label class="label">正文（可选）</label><textarea value="{{form.content}}" data-field="content" bindinput="input" maxlength="8000" disabled="{{busy || resourceStatus === 'published'}}"/><label class="label">来源说明（可选）</label><input value="{{form.sourceLabel}}" data-field="sourceLabel" bindinput="input" maxlength="160" disabled="{{busy || resourceStatus === 'published'}}"/><label class="label">来源 HTTPS 链接（可选）</label><input value="{{form.sourceUrl}}" data-field="sourceUrl" bindinput="input" maxlength="2000" disabled="{{busy || resourceStatus === 'published'}}"/><view class="muted">发布时需至少有正文或来源链接；外部链接会以“复制”方式交给用户打开。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{message}}" class="notice">{{message}}</view><block wx:if="{{resourceStatus === 'draft'}}"><button class="secondary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="save">保存草稿</button><button class="primary" disabled="{{busy || dirty || !version}}" bindtap="publish">发布资源</button><view wx:if="{{dirty || !version}}" class="muted">请先保存当前内容，再发布。</view></block></view></view>
